course: dictionary
lesson: 7599
title: The word prince
level: primary-5
stars: 0
explain: A prince is a son or grandson of a king or queen. So a prince is born into a royal family, and he may one day rule.
explain: Some princes rule a small country themselves. In stories, a prince is often a royal young man and a hero. Context tells you which meaning the author means.
explain: «Prince Volodymyr of Kyiv» is a real prince from history, while «Isla predicts the princess will save herself instead of waiting for a prince» is talking about stories. Read the words around prince to see which meaning fits.
fact: A prince is a son or grandson of a king or queen.
fact: A prince can also be a man who rules a small country.
fact: In stories, a prince is a royal young man, often a hero.
fact: A crown prince is the one who will become king.
fact: Prince Charming and the Little Prince are famous names that use the word prince.
exercise: «Isla predicts the princess will save herself instead of waiting for a prince.» In this sentence, what is a prince? | A girl who rides horses | A kind of farm animal | A plant that grows in ponds | *A royal young man, often a hero in stories
exercise: What is a crown prince? | A prince who sells crowns in a market | A prince who has lost his crown | A king who is very old | *The son who will one day be king
exercise: A prince is the son or ___ of a king or queen. | daughter | neighbour | *grandson | teacher
test: «As a young pagan prince he fought his own brothers for the throne.» In this sentence, prince means | A tall tree | A pupil at a school | A kind of bread | *A royal young man in a royal family
test: Some princes rule a small country. What does this mean? | *A prince who is the ruler of a small country | A prince who cooks food for the king | A prince who lives in a forest | A prince who has no home
exam: «Prince Volodymyr of Kyiv took Christianity from Byzantium around 988.» Which clue shows that prince means a real ruler here? | Christianity is an old word | *Kyiv was a real land he ruled, so he was a real ruler | Byzantium is far away | His name is very long
